ers/enigmaticrex/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enigmaticrex/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"89c474a61cfc675fe91f625e5b0ba246a669b1cc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sainsaji/EVO-PLAYER-PS5/commits/89c474a61cfc675fe91f625e5b0ba246a669b1cc","html_url":"https://github.com/sainsaji/EVO-PLAYER-PS5/commit/89c474a61cfc675fe91f625e5b0ba246a669b1cc"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"6a944f435c1f77768611539cbd691f4b2c429e96","node_id":"C_kwDOTzGnatoAKDZhOTQ0ZjQzNWMxZjc3NzY4NjExNTM5Y2JkNjkxZjRiMmM0MjllOTY","commit":{"author":{"name":"sain.saji","email":"sain.sajix@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-03T15:15:29Z"},"committer":{"name":"sain.saji","email":"sain.sajix@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-03T15:15:29Z"},"message":"gate pp_agc_init behind --agc-probe — unproven GPU path crashes 4K\n\nFirst hardware run of #27's sceAgc NV12 present path (this branch is the\nfirst .ffpfsc that contains 2c0ee0c): pp_agc_present_nv12's GPU submit\n(sceAgcDriverSubmitDcb -> sceAgcSuspendPoint) never returns -> GTA VI 4K\nhangs then crashes, right after 006B_VO_RECONFIG_APPLIED.\n\nmain.c armed pp_agc unconditionally for every app-module build, so the\nnative decoder emits NV12 and pp_playback routes it into the GPU path.\nGate it behind --agc-probe (which arms AGC via evo_agc_probe() anyway).\nDefault .ffpfsc now uses the CPU V8 converter (YUV420P, #31-proven);\nGTA 4K plays again. No effect on #6's rotate-ring change.\n\nHardware-verified for #6: 1080p ok, 4K TearsOfSteel ok.\nSeek on native 4K -> \"too demanding\" (0x811d0303 after flush) is\npre-existing and unrelated.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fe4158b57ecf17dddef2855ad18939227a35bfca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sainsaji/EVO-PLAYER-PS5/git/trees/fe4158b57ecf17dddef2855ad18939227a35bfca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sainsaji/EVO-PLAYER-PS5/git/commits/6a944f435c1f77768611539cbd691f4b2